External system dependencies
----------------------------

Herodium may install or integrate with external system packages such as:
ClamAV, Fail2Ban, Rkhunter, Timeshift, AppArmor, iptables/ipset, systemd,
zram-tools, logrotate, and Maltrail.

These tools are not part of Herodium's source code and remain licensed
under their own respective licenses.
